{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "alert-dialog",
  "title": "Alert dialog",
  "group": "Overlays",
  "order": 2,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A dialog that confirms a destructive or irreversible action. The title names the object and the consequence; the safe button gets focus; the destructive button is the only place `btn--danger` belongs.",
    "id": "Dialog yang meminta konfirmasi untuk aksi yang destruktif atau tidak bisa dibatalkan. Judulnya menyebut objek dan akibatnya; tombol aman mendapat fokus; tombol destruktif adalah satu-satunya tempat `btn--danger`."
  },
  "titleId": "Alert dialog",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Delete a service",
        "desc": "Focus lands on \"Keep service\", so a stray Enter is safe. Escape, the scrim and \"Keep service\" all cancel.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--danger-tinted btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ad-delete\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Delete service</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ad-delete\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ad-delete\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ad-delete-t\" aria-describedby=\"ad-delete-b\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"dialog__icon\"><span class=\"ic ic--fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></div>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ad-delete-t\">Delete the Micro business permit service?</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\" id=\"ad-delete-b\">All applications and their files are removed for every applicant. This cannot be undone.</p>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close data-lds-autofocus>Keep service</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger btn--md\" data-lds-close>Delete</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Remove a member",
        "desc": "A warning icon when the action is reversible by someone else but not by this person.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--danger-tinted btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ad-remove\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Remove from team</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ad-remove\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ad-remove\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ad-remove-t\" aria-describedby=\"ad-remove-b\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"dialog__icon\"><span class=\"ic ic--fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">warning</span></div>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ad-remove-t\">Remove Rina Wijaya from the verification team?</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\" id=\"ad-remove-b\">She loses access to application files and her work history is archived. Only an administrator can add her back.</p>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close data-lds-autofocus>Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger btn--md\" data-lds-close>Remove</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Hapus layanan",
        "desc": "Fokus mendarat di \"Simpan layanan\", sehingga Enter yang tak sengaja tetap aman. Escape, scrim, dan \"Simpan layanan\" semuanya membatalkan.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--danger-tinted btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ad-delete\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span>Hapus layanan</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ad-delete\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ad-delete\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ad-delete-t\" aria-describedby=\"ad-delete-b\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"dialog__icon\"><span class=\"ic ic--fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></div>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ad-delete-t\">Hapus layanan Izin usaha mikro?</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\" id=\"ad-delete-b\">Semua permohonan dan berkasnya dihapus untuk setiap pemohon. Tindakan ini tidak bisa dibatalkan.</p>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close data-lds-autofocus>Simpan layanan</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger btn--md\" data-lds-close>Hapus</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Keluarkan anggota",
        "desc": "Ikon peringatan saat aksinya bisa dikembalikan oleh orang lain, tetapi tidak oleh orang ini.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--danger-tinted btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"ad-remove\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Keluarkan dari tim</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"ad-remove\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"ad-remove\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ad-remove-t\" aria-describedby=\"ad-remove-b\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"dialog__icon\"><span class=\"ic ic--fill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">warning</span></div>\n    <h3 class=\"dialog__title\" id=\"ad-remove-t\">Keluarkan Rina Wijaya dari tim verifikasi?</h3>\n    <p class=\"dialog__body\" id=\"ad-remove-b\">Ia kehilangan akses ke berkas permohonan dan riwayat kerjanya diarsipkan. Hanya administrator yang bisa menambahkannya kembali.</p>\n    <div class=\"dialog__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-close data-lds-autofocus>Batal</button><button class=\"btn btn--danger btn--md\" data-lds-close>Keluarkan</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "dialog",
    "modal",
    "toast",
    "confirm-in-place"
  ]
}
